      "writtenOn": "2024-05-09T17:19:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it needs to be done for this CL, but I wonder if we could make the code cleaner by creating a `class ZephyrTestConfig` that inherits from `TestConfig` and adds the Zephyr-specific configuration. Same with `BoardConfig`.",
