      "writtenOn": "2024-05-10T05:52:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"Zephyr test\" may refer to:\n1. Our, newly migrated test running with EC based on ZephyrRTOS\n2. The Zephyr upstream test, built with twister and run on our dev board.\n\nFor 1. I wouldn\u0027t create a new `class ZephyrTestConfig`. For 2. I\u0027m not sure, I don\u0027t think it is needed for now. There is only one additional member `zephyr_name` needed for running the upstream tests. I don\u0027t have strong opinion here.\n\nRegarding a new `class BoardConfig` for boards using Zephyr. I think we may even need new objects for Zephyr boards, with new RO variants",
      "parentUuid": "47385bad_66712063",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 233,
        "endChar": 27
      },
